  "notes": {
    "nA": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 560,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "DESIGNS v3 · FULL VISUAL STYLE (22 OCT)\n\nEvery screen is now designed in the approved visual style: logo, rounded cards on linen, coloured session pictures, brand fonts.\n\nAmber tag = waiting on you (wording, pictures).\nPurple tag = +1 month release.\n\nNames and numbers are examples. Session pictures are placeholders until the illustrations are ready.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 3330,
      "y": 0
    },
    "nB": {
      "fill": "green",
      "maxH": 620,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "DECISIONS BUILT IN (21–22 OCT)\n\n• Timetable: List (default), Week and Month views\n• Free cancellation until 20:00 the evening before; after that, Cancel becomes Message us\n• 1 parent + up to 2 children per booking\n• Open play: 1 credit or 150,000 VND per child, parents free\n• Several dates are picked one by one; nothing repeats\n• No 'Pay now' line, no waitlist",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 3330,
      "y": 1244
    },
    "nC": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 520,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "ROLES\n\nInstructors don't see Catalog, Reports, Staff or Settings, and can't sell packs, record payments or restore credits.\n\nThe database refuses these actions too, not just the menu.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 6840,
      "y": 2488
    },
    "nD": {
      "fill": "green",
      "maxH": 520,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "ANSWERED 21 OCT\n\nWhen staff drag a session to a new time, the bookings move with it and everyone booked gets an email. A move that would overlap another session is blocked.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 6840,
      "y": 3788
    },
    "nE": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 400,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "The most common way bookings will be made: open the session, search the name, tap Book. The customer still gets the confirmation email.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 1920,
      "y": 5088
    },
    "nF": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 420,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Draft wording from the requirements doc. Photos, quotes, address and hours are placeholders until you supply them.\n\nEvery Book button opens book.thevillagesaigon.com.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 6332
    },
    "nG": {
      "fill": "green",
      "maxH": 700,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "VISUAL STYLE v1 · APPROVED 21 OCT\n\nThe reference boards for the look. Every screen above now follows them.",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 5530,
      "y": 8932
    },
    "nH": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 500,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "QUESTIONS\n\n1. Coral and forrest differ slightly between the brand guide and the logo files. Which is the master?\n2. Can we get SVGs of the full-colour wordmark and the badges?\n3. Session pictures are placeholders until the illustrations are ready.",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 5530,
      "y": 9692
    },
    "nP": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "maxH": 560,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "TRY IT ON YOUR PHONE\n\nOpen 'C1 · Log in' and press Play. Tap through like a parent:\n\nSend me a code → Log in → Book a class → Confirm → See my bookings → Cancel.\n\nAlso try: Book as a guest, Open Play, Pick dates, Packages, the menu and Hire the studio.\n\nOnly the main buttons work; filters and language switch are for show.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 3330,
      "y": 620
    },
    "nW": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 520,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "NEW 22 OCT: WEEK AND MONTH VIEWS\n\nAsked for by the owners. This brings back views dropped on 21 Oct to save time.\n\nList stays the default. Tap a session block (week) or a day (month) to book.\n\nAdds roughly a few hours to the build.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 4770,
      "y": 0
    },
